[{"client_msg_id":"7cecfbe6-61ab-4b57-ae10-2646c6d14677","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"逆に言うとこっちである程度調べる能力と時間があれば、ちゃんと答えてくれると。","ts":"1632999419.430900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"btrXH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"198a1efb-b75a-4965-ae66-7d524a2c7476","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"まじで、税のことはプロに聞かなわからんなと思いました","ts":"1632999350.429900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UAZ33BKV2","U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOo9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e46017ca-4c59-435b-8f34-5161105c18cc","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"会社だと赤字の繰越ができるけど、個人はこうやるのか。","ts":"1632999290.429500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2hmJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f237e021-4784-4af5-a80f-eaf04fa9aab8","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"税務署のカルマが上がりそう","ts":"1632999026.428900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TIl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"A38ABDA9-9264-42E9-AA4A-19A4642470B5","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"税務署++","ts":"1632998977.428700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JI4u"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ae1fc8ae-83a6-49ea-8417-9923654d0b33","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"税務署の人も知らなかったみたいで、調べて折り返してくれました。勉強になりましたと言われたw私も電話口だけでは理解できず、*変動所得及び臨時所得の平均課税*の書類を見てようやく理解しました。","ts":"1632998252.428000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":2,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vY3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"856d539c-a50e-412a-9959-c5f300fa57aa","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"間が空きましたが、本件を税務署に問い合わせてみました。要約すると\n\n• 白色申告の場合、損失申告しても翌年の利益に対する経費として埋め合わせることはできない\n• *変動所得及び臨時所得の平均課税*という仕組みで所得税の負担を軽くできる場合はある。ただし、適用可能なのは、直近2年どちらかで変動所得が発生している場合（両方損失だとNG）\nって感じみたいです\n\u003chttps://www.nta.go.jp/law/tsutatsu/kihon/shotoku/17/01.htm\u003e","ts":"1632998118.426900","thread_ts":"1631799537.360000","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1632998960.000000"},"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XVKX"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"2f37cee9-51d0-4101-bbbb-0e0760d2f52f","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"今、執筆している原稿料が来年入るので、変動所得として少なくとも今年の出費を経費にしようと思ってます。\n↓のPDFの「一般の純損失及び雑損失」を読むに白色申告の場合は、損失申告が不要っぽいのですが、何年分まで繰り越せるんでしょうか……？\n\u003chttps://www.nta.go.jp/taxes/shiraberu/shinkoku/tebiki/2012/pdf/03.pdf\u003e","ts":"1631799537.360000","thread_ts":"1631799537.360000","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"quY"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"5a5656aa-85a4-4eff-866e-723857aa871e","type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"自社株非公開だから知ったところで何かできるわけでもないのですが","ts":"1632964908.426800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UX3l5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69f48049-8584-40a3-ba13-6dd829e32e23","type":"message","user":"U023H98P3N0","text":"資産の分散から見ると、業績ダウンが株価と給与のダブルパンチになりそうだけどどうなんだろ？","ts":"1632964858.425800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2=f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e3b712ff-059d-456e-b242-664a3766607d","type":"message","user":"U72TB62UF","text":"社内で買った自社株とインデックス投資しているところが別管理になるのがめんどいのでやってない。\n自社株買って、半年後にSBIなり楽天なりに移動できるならいいんだけど…","ts":"1632954313.423300","edited":{"user":"U72TB62UF","ts":"1632954436.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fEy0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"27c5341a-2f83-4942-a9aa-0774202d46bf","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"内気なサイダー","ts":"1632952649.422100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"rhinoceros","count":2,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U72TB62UF"]},{"name":"dart","count":2,"users":["U0238G3KV8D","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XVsZZ"}]}]
